//　……その名は<RUBY text='たわらただつな'>田原忠綱</RUBY>。足利氏の流である。
  Lady Sakurako's eyes are open wide, mouth covered by one trembling hand. Does she see her father there upon the stage?

  And now Yorimasa, as if for her ears alone, launches into a paean to his gallant foe. This general's name was Tawara Tadatsuna. He was a scion of the Ashikaga clan.

